nd="04:20.579">u </span><span begin="04:20.579" end="04:20.779">tsu </span><span begin="04:20.779" end="04:21.639">su </span><span begin="04:22.023" end="04:22.203">ka </span><span begin="04:22.203" end="04:22.403">ga </span><span begin="04:22.403" end="04:22.683">mi </span><span begin="04:22.683" end="04:23.043">ga </span><span begin="04:23.043" end="04:23.423">ho </span><span begin="04:23.423" end="04:24.843">shi </span><span begin="04:24.843" end="04:24.863">i</span></text><text for="line-bfbdcd43-1d85-46a9-af7d-2ec4ca68c05f"><span begin="04:25.303" end="04:25.843">fu </span><span begin="04:25.843" end="04:26.363">ru </span><span begin="04:26.363" end="04:26.783">e </span><span begin="04:26.783" end="04:27.843">te </span><span begin="04:27.843" end="04:27.983">yu </span><span begin="04:27.983" end="04:28.203">re </span><span begin="04:28.203" end="04:28.483">ru </span><span begin="04:28.483" end="04:28.903">ki </span><span begin="04:28.903" end="04:29.263">mo </span><span begin="04:29.263" end="04:29.563">chi</span></text><text for="2022de55-a259-4848-a6fd-570fad2fb414"><span begin="04:29.563" end="04:29.963">a </span><span begin="04:29.963" end="04:30.323">fu </span><span begin="04:30.323" end="04:30.623">re </span><span begin="04:30.623" end="04:30.863">so </span><span begin="04:30.863" end="04:31.783">u</span></text><text for="line-d6eb0def-05a0-4622-a4a9-c4e90b15a18d"><span begin="04:32.143" end="04:32.323">a </span><span begin="04:32.323" end="04:32.543">na </span><span begin="04:32.543" end="04:32.803">ta </span><span begin="04:32.803" end="04:33.143">no </span><span begin="04:33.143" end="04:33.583">i </span><span begin="04:33.583" end="04:33.803">ro </span><span begin="04:33.803" end="04:34.723">ni</span></text><text for="6d59509e-5dc8-4d80-b1a2-231fc6b1160d"><span begin="04:34.723" end="04:35.043">ta </span><span begin="04:35.043" end="04:35.343">da </span><span begin="04:35.343" end="04:36.143">so </span><span begin="04:36.143" end="04:36.843">ma </span><span begin="04:36.843" end="04:37.603">ri </span><span begin="04:37.603" end="04:37.923">ta </span><span begin="04:37.923" end="04:38.663">ku </span><span begin="04:38.663" end="04:40.623">te</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="line-60f1b037-379c-435d-a8b8-fd6d88d79927">登上这条坡道</text><text for="line-16e16f04-f2d5-471d-9921-0932807b0913">为什么现在的两人</text><text for="line-7fac1a35-6319-49dc-8394-6180d2a8121d">未尽的话语</text><text for="line-5c2555d4-6436-40c1-b9c1-297e5871d31c">但却仰望着流动的云彩</text><text for="line-b37eb88f-8cb4-464e-970d-928beb555b6a">在白色的季节启程</text><text for="line-46594716-2cf6-4cc1-8fd8-b888a5645b04">其他的事情已不再重要</text><text for="line-8bfeb460-d020-4908-8277-bddc0929c9a5">告诉我们二人的未来吧</text><text for="line-e9bad786-2854-497b-a906-072c6e2e5a90">想要能映出未来的镜子</text><text for="line-cda323ba-a944-47e3-af3a-be05f39ba3c1">摇曳颤抖的心情</text><text for="line-5f7e6701-4bd4-4d72-9e22-163df4478480">唯独你的色彩</text><text for="line-e0e573c2-a5e0-4f06-ad3f-784c6c223c0a">真不可思议呢 是从何时起呢</text><text for="line-52cec51f-03dc-4df9-a073-ff4b0093f6ec">就让我们心灵相通吧</text><text for="line-50cde54c-b6fb-42c6-b0ed-efeccdb31a20">如小鸟般等待的我</text><text for="line-d8c7e3b1-7c8e-4d7b-8fc5-c5390a98a7ec">甜美果实爆裂的刹那</text><text for="line-5cbf068b-4775-4a32-9f8b-e96aff04eea0">点点指尖 勾勒着名字</text><text for="line-ecee9c62-1ba2-4681-ad1a-fd788c8e3908">这温柔的时间</text><text for="line-7c57c009-1681-4e6f-ae05-41f3662035f0">传递给你 在淡淡的心愿消逝之前</text><text for="line-a7445b60-c141-4716-af17-157fbcf86a9b">在你的怀里看到了沉睡的梦</text><text for="line-90aefb83-e984-4847-a2b8-4dd4e8934733">在白色的季节启程</text><text for="line-4b1ae43d-aa52-4557-874d-5ff868eaf135">其他的事情已不再重要</text><text for="line-267d6070-7c90-46b3-a00b-d4d6c6b3afb7">告诉我们二人的未来吧</text><text for="line-2102ad65-a671-4ed3-801f-34ad436c7656">想要能映出未来的镜子</text><text for="line-bfbdcd43-1d85-46a9-af7d-2ec4ca68c05f">摇曳颤抖的心情</text><text for="line-d6eb0def-05a0-4622-a4a9-c4e90b15a18d">唯独你的色彩</text><text for="56307be4-f963-4fd4-abc3-b35436a1800a">留下驻足的身影</text><text for="80fc9841-382e-454c-934b-59b1f44b801c">这样迎风而立</text><text for="800c2d39-38ec-471d-983e-341101c28e5c">虽然快要让人哭泣</text><text for="b065074a-286c-4a51-9e7f-0bee83ee272c">轻声说道：“没关系”</text><text for="ecedcaf3-ab55-40a6-adca-e25551322f0f">两枚车票的旅途</text><text for="9a502f6b-7399-4e2a-b85c-c3bf1ffb8617">只想看着你的侧脸</text><text for="63d514a8-1e26-4dea-8ddb-037e9c1e2200">就要满溢</text><text for="f1e5e587-16ea-452b-8503-d74bdc3fb4b5">想要为此浸染</text><text for="734ad0ca-37b3-4bfc-9c5a-73f43b1247fa">变得这么透明</text><text for="d22a3a4b-3a58-4b3b-95e8-8aedfb95688e">还是想相信命运一回！</text><text for="ef7d7d0d-d92f-4656-abcb-123995e1602c">甚至不敢大口呼吸</text><text for="3395c4c3-eac8-4c3e-ba05-79c92df4ae46">会有所改变的吧</text><text for="875120f6-bbb7-47ea-9f3a-13f72704c927">描绘着微笑</text><text for="442150cc-6e8e-4749-ab25-57e4b1defc8d">两枚车票的旅途</text><text for="e3c8c89b-fbd7-4849-9055-dda4627ec4fd">只想看着你的侧脸</text><text for="2022de55-a259-4848-a6fd-570fad2fb414">就要满溢</text><text for="6d59509e-5dc8-4d80-b1a2-231fc6b1160d">想要为此浸染</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="04:40.623"><div><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-60f1b037-379c-435d-a8b8-fd6d88d79927" itunes:key="line-60f1b037-379c-435d-a8b8-fd6d88d79927" begin="00:24.266" end="00:28.711"><span begin="00:24.266" end="00:24.626">の</span><span begin="00:24.626" end="00:24.966">ぼ</span><span begin="00:24.966" end="00:25.226">っ</span><span begin="00:25.226" end="00:25.966">た</span><span begin="00:26.791" end="00:27.511" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">坂</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:26.791" end="00:27.151">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:27.151" end="00:27.511">か</span></span></span><span begin="00:27.511" end="00:28.031" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">道</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:27.511" end="00:27.791">み</span><span tts:ruby